WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:05.670
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and Agents of
SHIELD totally just took a field trip to TAHITI.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:09.970
There was a temporary resolution to the Skye
cliffhanger and two more characters from the

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:10.970
comic books were featured.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.480
There was also something of a reveal at the
end.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.480
So first let’s talk about our top 5 WTF
moments, then I’ll tell you some of my theories

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.480
of what that big reveal was at the end and
then my review.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.849
In case you’re finding me for the first
time, usually Tuesdays are dedicated to Marvel

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:17.849
videos.

00:00:17.849 --> 00:00:26.750
I usually do Agents of SHIELD when there’s
a new episode and a Marvel Movie video.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.199
This week was a little different just because
there were some important trailers to do.

00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:31.550
But let’s talk some TAHITI.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.980
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.769
But Number 5 - Melinda May frees the beast
all over Quinn.

00:00:37.769 --> 00:00:42.050
This is ABC so I didn’t expect her to give
him the business to badly but it was still

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.050
pretty fun.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.910
They hadn’t done much with the Quinn character
after they captured him.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:48.100
I would have thought Ward would have been
the first one to smash his face.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:52.899
They whole moment was really used just to
get Coulson to figure out that the Clairvoyant

00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:57.320
wanted Quinn to shoot Skye so that Coulson
would take her to the TAHITI place and give

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.399
her whatever super serum he received.

00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:00.899
Plans within plans.

00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:04.110
This really only sucks if you’re Skye because
shooting her was a red herring.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.830
It had nothing to do with killing her.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:09.340
Number 4 - Bill Paxton guest stars as Agent
Garrett from the comics.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.321
It’s always fun to see people from the comics.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:15.010
In the comics Garrett is mostly known as a
former SHIELD agent who was turned into a

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.010
cyborg.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.000
Like the same type of thing that happened
to Mike earlier this season.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.410
Before he became a SHIELD agent he was guilty
of all kinds of awful stuff.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:26.120
Had he been in the DC Universe he would have
been recruited for the Suicide Squad.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.400
That’s how bad he was.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.300
Eventually he even was flagged as a potential
future Avenger.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.160
All I could think of when he was on screen
was Aliens when the Colonial Marines were

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.160
searching for Aliens.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.710
Which is actually kind of relevant to one
of my other top moments.

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:42.330
Number 3 - TAHITI isn’t such a magical place
after all.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.820
So this was a bit misleading.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:47.110
Because TAHITI turned out to be a special
facility with a miracle drug.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:50.300
So it kind of was a magical place.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.850
I had hoped that they would find more teasers
there than they did.

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:56.630
But a couple of things we learned were that
Nick Fury is a level 10 agent.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:58.500
Meaning it probably stops at 10.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.810
More to the fact, WTF does TAHITI stand for.

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.860
It’s an acronym, so let’s try to solve
that rubix cube in the comments.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.539
Speaking of which, who else got a tesseract
vibe from the computer database Fitz and Simmons

00:02:08.539 --> 00:02:09.960
used to find the location.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:14.120
It’s a SHIELD blacksite, meaning there are
probably more hidden illegal underground bunkers

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.770
like this all over the world.

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:19.580
The Winter Soldier is going to deal with some
of these secrets within secrets that Coulson

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.010
dealt with this week.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.902
Number 2 - The regenerative serum they gave
to Skye.

00:02:22.902 --> 00:02:27.630
The whole conceit before it was revealed to
us was that the serum was what made Coulson

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.390
go crazy and want to die during his regeneration.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.690
That’s why he didn’t want them to give
it to Skye.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.690
If you didn’t catch it, Coulson and the
team talk about how she didn’t make any

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.630
noise when they gave it to her.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.160
Meaning she didn’t have a violent reaction
to it like coulson.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.700
I’ll talk more about that in just a sec.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:47.860
and my Number 1 moment - The blue alien inside
the TAHITI room.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:51.260
So many WTF things about this, so let’s
start with the biggest part.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.610
Who is he?

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:57.390
Well Marvel doesn’t legally have rights
to use the Kree and the other possibilities

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:58.960
are Frost Giant and Centaurian.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:02.360
The Centaurian’s are who the race Yondu
from Guardians of The Galaxy are.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:06.010
He’s being played by Michael Rooker and
as you can see.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.360
The person in the tank does look larger than
that.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.810
So I really do think it’s a Frost Giant.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:14.630
It would certainly fit with all the other
connective Thor tissue the show has had this

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.630
season.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:19.180
So what does it mean that Skye didn’t flip
out when she took Frost Giant blood.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:21.270
She has Frost Giant DNA.

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:25.980
Who else do we know in the Marvel Universe
that looks like a normal person but is really

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.069
a Frost Giant...Hmmm…Loki of Course.

00:03:28.069 --> 00:03:31.950
He’s 100 percent Frost Giant but was like
the runt of the litter.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.560
So just because Sky is potentially a Frost
Giant doesn’t mean that she’s related

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.590
to Loki.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:37.820
But hopefully we’ll find out.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:42.680
Isn’t it just so curious that the next episode
is another Thor-based episode with Lady Sif

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.090
and Lorelai?

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:48.660
There are no coincidences.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.240
My Loki Clairvoyant theory is starting to
seem less crazy though.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:56.380
But alternately, it’s totally possible that
Marvel worked out the legal mumbo jumbo to

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.430
use the Kree and that’s who it is.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:01.421
It would be a bit left field seeing as we
haven’t seen the Kree anywhere in a Movie

00:04:01.421 --> 00:04:12.870
yet and introducing them would be a huge deal.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.270
But let me know what your vote is.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.359
Was the blue alien a Frost Giant or was it
Kree?

00:04:17.359 --> 00:04:20.989
Remember, it was really just the upper half
of an alien.

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:23.520
Overall I gave the episode a solid B plus.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:27.490
Even though they showed a freaking alien,
the episode had it’s lowest ratings all

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.490
season.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.169
We can probably blame the olympics for that,
but the story was great.

00:04:31.169 --> 00:04:34.629
The only thing that I didn’t like was the
Hospital scene.

00:04:34.629 --> 00:04:38.240
It felt like they were trying to do a mini
episode of ER or Grey’s Anatomy.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:40.330
I don’t like hospital shows if you can’t
tell.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:44.139
Bill Paxton was great as a sleazebag SHIELD
agent from the comics.

00:04:44.139 --> 00:04:47.909
And as much as people are down on the show
I think that once they reveal the truth behind

00:04:47.909 --> 00:04:52.180
whatever the mystery of Skye’s parentage,
The Clairvoyant and Coulson’s mystery serum

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:56.180
are the show is going to exist in that meta
comic book place that everyone wants it to

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.180
be in.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:01.560
Like I said next week Lorelai is even bringing
magic into the world, the world of SHIELD

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.560
so to speak.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:06.320
I have some suspicions about the nature of
magic in Thor as Loki practices it too.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.409
One of the cool things we learned about that
from Dark World was that Frigga, his mother

00:05:10.409 --> 00:05:13.650
played by Renee Russo, was the one who taught
him magic.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:17.559
I’ll be really interested if it turns out
Skye really is part Frost Giant because it

00:05:17.559 --> 00:05:21.729
provides some interesting opportunities to
mirror Loki’s narrative.

00:05:21.729 --> 00:05:26.280
Finding out you descend from your sworn enemies,
but you made a home with a different race

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.280
of beings.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.449
Loki obviously went a little nutters, but
he is named after the god of mischief.

00:05:30.449 --> 00:05:33.850
In other news, lot of awesome comic book bombs
being dropped on Arrow.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:39.190
If you’re not watching it yet, they’re
bringing on the Suicide Squad and they just

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:40.999
teased Harley Quinn for the next episode.

00:05:40.999 --> 00:05:42.779
I’ll be talking about that tonight.

00:05:42.779 --> 00:05:45.120
Be sure to subscribe to get that video.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.462
Also feel free to leave suggestions for my
next Marvel Tuesday video.

00:05:47.462 --> 00:05:49.270
Mostly I like them to be movie related.

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:53.349
Right now click here to learn all about my
Loki Clairvoyant Theories, it’s still totally

00:05:53.349 --> 00:05:54.659
up for debate.

00:05:54.659 --> 00:05:58.249
and click here to learn about my top 5 choices
for the next Captain America movie.

00:05:58.249 --> 00:06:00.280
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:00.860
High Fives!

